Hello,

You can use the package {poppr} for this purpose as it works quite well 
with adegenet. In particular, you might be interested in the "clone 
correction" feature that will remove duplicates from your analysis:

https://grunwaldlab.github.io/poppr/articles/mlg.html#clone-correction-1

Hope that helps,
Zhian

